self.KB_CONTENT["card:782790"]={"id":"card:782790","ty":"card","sourceId":"782790","title":"『E-BOM 用量資料建立』中的『屬性 (BOM.MI009)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"品號","keywords":["品號","採購","加工","用量"],"y":"other","answer":"* 顯示該品號之屬性。* 為主件品號之屬性為P.採購件、M.自製件、S.託外加工件、Y.虛設件、F.Feature件及O.Option件。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
