self.KB_CONTENT["card:757671"]={"id":"card:757671","ty":"card","sourceId":"757671","title":"『進貨折讓單憑證列印作業』中的『選擇FAX/Email傳送狀態』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"折讓單","keywords":["折讓單","進貨","憑證","狀態"],"y":"other","answer":"* 計Y.已傳送、N.未傳送及全部(不必篩選FAX)。* 尚未購買『FAX/Email處理系統』(FEP)者，FAX/Email欄位需隱藏。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
